  "prompt": "Enforce these business limits when an order is created:\n\n- at most 20 line items per order;\n- each line item's quantity is at most 100;\n- the order subtotal is at most 1,000,000 cents.\n\nA request that breaks a limit returns status 422 with `{\"error\": <message>}` and creates no order, where the message is `\"too many line items\"`, `\"quantity exceeds limit\"` or `\"order total exceeds limit\"` (checked in that order). Requests with the wrong shape or types keep returning 400 exactly as now. Orders within the limits are created as now.\n\nWork in this repository until the request is complete, then reply with a short summary of what you changed.",
